{"base_manifest_sha256":"531f85386978d805de3756d2d1c70d748a4cd392c0caad3c4173e8a9d9c6fa06","review":{"basis":"Economic orders freeze quantity at confirmed creation close, with explicit qty precedence and downward rounding only for derived quantities. This bounded creation-time policy deliberately differs from fill-time equity sizing; gaps change notional, not frozen units. Flat fees are charged on the first actual fill per order ID. Legacy names/early signatures are reconstructed; no external execution equivalence is claimed.","date":"2026-10-25","decisions":["All six versions have separate evidence. Early signatures and execution decisions are explicit reconstructions.","Explicit qty overrides defaults. Derived cash/percent units floor to the pinned step at confirmed creation close. No future price, close or fill is consulted.","Official equity-at-opening guidance is not claimed as implemented. This profile deliberately freezes creation-time units so pending reservations and OCA have exact quantities; gaps change exposure, not units.","New header defaults to fixed/one. Old headers retain their previous admission and defaults. New settings carry only explicit step/minimum facts; absent limits remain unknown.","Percent fees apply to each fill value, per-contract fees to each actual filled unit, flat per-order fees on the first actual fill of the order ID. Reversal close fill precedes open fill; no future fee redistribution.","Cancelled/unfilled orders cost zero. Replacement gets a new order identity. Only live paid order IDs and cumulative/retired counters survive checkpoint; ledger entry fee residues remain exact.","Only linear quote accounting with pointvalue one. No FX, collateral, margin, leverage enforcement, funding or external execution equivalence."],"external_pine_execution":false,"sources":[{"date":"2026-10-25","facts":{"cash_example":"The v5/v6 cash reference example divides the amount by close price.","fees":"Fees can be percent of transaction value, cash per unit, or cash per order.","modes":"Fixed units, account-currency amount and percentage of equity are distinct sizing modes.","official_equity_timing":"The support guide describes available equity when the trade opens.","quantity_override":"An explicit non-na qty overrides the default mode and value."},"selected_facts_sha256":"c1faa56dd4bc0974986347945d0e010bc885c95ef6fe0ea286e6aaa9fb9cd37b","urls":["https://www.tradingview.com/support/solutions/43000628599-strategy-properties/","https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-docs/concepts/strategies/","https://www.tradingview.com/pine-script-reference/v6/"]}],"test_refs":["tests/test_economics.py","tests/test_economics_pipeline.py","conformance/economics/cases.json"]},"schema_version":"openpine.economics-spec.1","version_review_manifest_sha256":"019cb2a538398fce686c2475860106997959c32095001bb068b4b2c0158b8aca","versions":{"1":{"apis":[["strategy","simulation.strategy_economics",[["title","string","const",null],["overlay","bool","const",false],["pyramiding","int","const",0],["default_qty_type","string","const","fixed"],["default_qty_value","float","const",1.0],["initial_capital","float","const",100000.0],["slippage","int","const",0],["commission_type","string","const","percent"],["commission_value","float","const",0.0],["close_entries_rule","string","const","FIFO"]]]],"evidence":[{"entry_id":"wiki:v1:constants:strategy.cash","source_record_sha256":"c47e6c84e486d4927a87c89cc1afb59cc4d96cfec0e4aa81cddcaf40a12cbb45"},{"entry_id":"wiki:v1:constants:strategy.fixed","source_record_sha256":"631ac050343ec51d6a7a1adc3dde84ce48cb27a182510632e2237164f5ec7350"},{"entry_id":"wiki:v1:constants:strategy.percent_of_equity","source_record_sha256":"9e228d81d82a0cfc7bd1917167d970056d30f30793c66369de930b0810916957"},{"entry_id":"wiki:v1:functions:strategy","source_record_sha256":"7bac35169244339c365401a7a9ef206c7f42d81fdd3a8105a5ef59e31b70035f"},{"entry_id":"wiki:v1:functions:strategy.entry","source_record_sha256":"821d71177720d28e5afde56